{"text": " Narazul som na extr\u00e9mne dobr\u00fd c\u00edvina tohoj predlak\u0165a. To zeraj. A t\u00fdm mysl\u00edm konkr\u00e9tne tento sval tu pod n\u00e1zvom brachyho radi\u00e1lis \u010do je re\u00e1lne najv\u00e4\u010d\u0161\u00ed sval na tohoj predlak\u0165a. Pre\u010do je toto v\u00fdbornie c\u00edvina toho predlak\u0165a? Zaprv\u00e9, preto\u017ee brachyho radi\u00e1lis ma najlep\u0161iu aktiv\u00e1ciu ke\u010f ma\u0161 zohnut\u00e9 lakte, zruba pri t\u00fdch 90\u00b0 fleksie lakte. \u010c\u00edm viac ma\u0161 lakte\u0165 vystret\u00ed, t\u00fdm viac prebr\u00e1 pr\u00e1cu bicers. \u010co mu sa v takomto pr\u00edpade chceme vyhn\u00fa\u0165. No zl\u00e1dom k tomuto v\u00fdborn\u00e9mu setupu, kedy to rovi\u0161 posedia\u010dky, \u010ca nohy ani nepustia do v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ieho vystretia lak\u0165ou a po\u010das cel\u00e9ho tohto rosaho pohybu ma najv\u00e4\u010d\u0161iu aktiv\u00e1ciu pr\u00e1ve brachyho radi\u00e1lis. Klu\u010dovou podmienko\u0165 cvi\u010dne na toto cviku je cvi\u010dne to nad matom, ako to cvi\u010d\u00ed t\u00fato pan, kedy najviac vyhodn\u00ed\u0161 pr\u00e1ve brachyho radi\u00e1lis. Moja men\u0161ia rada ako tento cv\u00edk e\u0161te vylep\u0161i\u0165 pou\u017ei trh\u00e1\u010dky. Na to najm\u00e4 poke\u013e sa chce\u0161 zaceli\u0165 prim\u00e1rne iba na brachyho radi\u00e1lis a n\u00ed je aj na ostatn\u00e9 svali predlak\u0165a. Na ko\u013eko\u0165 a pri takomto uchopie nad matom ur\u010dite bude limitov\u00e1\u0165 sila tvojho uchopu za\u010do sa zodpovedne in\u00e9 svali predlak\u0165a. No poke\u013e sa je\u0161 ozvi\u010di\u0165 predlak\u0165a ako celok, tak klu\u010dne to cvi\u010d aj bestr\u00e1\u010diek. E\u0161te k tomu tento cvi\u010di\u0161 posedia\u010dky, tak\u017ee to je perfektne stabiln\u00e9 cv\u00edk, aby to nebolo m\u00e1lo, no re\u00e1lne si neviem predstav\u00ed lep\u0161\u00ed cv\u00edk na brachyho radi\u00e1lis ako je toto. \u010co\u017ee pokia\u013e s\u00fa predlak\u0165a svalova partia, ktor\u00fa by si chcel zlep\u0161i\u0165 toto jej cv\u00edk, ktor\u00fd by som ur\u010diti to svojho treningu by o pl\u00e1mu z\u00e1radil a pre viac je to do\u0161en\u00fd h\u013eadn\u00e1ko optim\u00e1liz\u00e1\u0165 svoj\u00ed treningy.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.5, "text": " Narazul som na extr\u00e9mne dobr\u00fd c\u00edvina tohoj predlak\u0165a.", "tokens": [50364, 13512, 921, 425, 3307, 1667, 16455, 4011, 716, 23067, 11822, 269, 45096, 1426, 281, 1289, 73, 3852, 75, 514, 27101, 64, 13, 50539], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3545014440165877, "compression_ratio": 1.5047021943573669, "no_speech_prob": 0.004379644989967346}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.5, "end": 4.5, "text": " To zeraj.", "tokens": [50539, 1407, 710, 1663, 73, 13, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3545014440165877, "compression_ratio": 1.5047021943573669, "no_speech_prob": 0.004379644989967346}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 9.700000000000001, "end": 15.0, "text": " A t\u00fdm mysl\u00edm konkr\u00e9tne tento sval tu pod n\u00e1zvom brachyho radi\u00e1lis \u010do je re\u00e1lne najv\u00e4\u010d\u0161\u00ed sval na tohoj predlak\u0165a.", "tokens": [50849, 316, 256, 11822, 76, 452, 10418, 14569, 21428, 81, 4051, 716, 7054, 78, 262, 3337, 2604, 2497, 297, 42970, 85, 298, 738, 608, 88, 1289, 16335, 11447, 271, 22392, 78, 1506, 319, 11447, 716, 11212, 17165, 10236, 48651, 262, 3337, 1667, 281, 1289, 73, 3852, 75, 514, 27101, 64, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3545014440165877, "compression_ratio": 1.5047021943573669, "no_speech_prob": 0.004379644989967346}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 15.0, "end": 17.0, "text": " Pre\u010do je toto v\u00fdbornie c\u00edvina toho predlak\u0165a?", "tokens": [51114, 6001, 10236, 78, 1506, 281, 1353, 371, 11822, 10324, 414, 269, 45096, 1426, 281, 1289, 3852, 75, 514, 27101, 64, 30, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3545014440165877, "compression_ratio": 1.5047021943573669, "no_speech_prob": 0.0043796